# Build context for railway/Dockerfile only (BuildKit prefers this file over
# the root .dockerignore). Kept here so the root file is never edited and
# upstream merges stay conflict-free. Lists both the old (harvey) and new
# (sellbird) layouts; whichever exists is copied.
**
!requirements.txt
!harvey.yaml
!sellbird.yaml
!harvey/
!harvey/**
!sellbird/
!sellbird/**
!prompts/
!prompts/**
!skills/
!skills/**
!railway/
!railway/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
